  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scholarship for Girl Education.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing the scholastic achievement of girls is a challenge in much of the developing world. The research study show that the scholarship program has a large, positive effect on the school enrollment and attendance of girls. Scholarships give promising learner an opportunity to pursue their education regardless of their financial circumstances. In order to help learners, Kamboo Project is providing the budget to a female learner to continue with their schooling without worries families.</narrative>
  </description>
